  "title": "Orange Sherbet I",
  "description": "Orange and lemon juice are combined with gelatin, whipped cream and a beaten egg-white and then frozen in this traditional, no-cook, made-in-the-freezer orange sherbet.",
  "authors": [
    "LUCY WILSON"
